  "title": "埃塞 - 古吉 乌拉嘎 果果谷 小农 Uraga Gogogu 水洗-黄柠檬、葡萄柚、杏桃、红茶感",
  "source_url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Zo6tijxI7ZYObiaaOrOSdw",
  "publish_time": 1777371354,
  "status": "body_recovered",
  "extraction_method": "article_dom",
  "body_text": "基本信息\n国家：埃塞俄比亚 Ethiopia\n产区：奥洛米亚洲-古吉-乌拉嘎 Oromia-Gu\nji-Uraga\n村落：维特-果果谷\nWate Gogogu\n处理站：果果谷 Gogogu\n负责人/拥有者：\nNigusse Debela（SNAP）\n品种：原生种 Heirloom (Dega, Kurume)\n‍\n海拔：2100 - 2300 米 masl\n处理方式：水洗 Washed\n采收处理： 2025.12 - 2026.1月\n空运到港： 2026.4月\n烘焙度：浅度 Light Roasted\n风味：黄柠檬、葡萄柚、杏桃、红茶感\nLemon, Grapefruit, Apricot, Black tea-like\n今年的批次到库啦，和去年还是很一致的，依旧是扎实的酸感，柠檬红茶，还有一些杏桃和红心柚子的感受，饱满，风味辨识度非常高（据说还有花香，还还没有喝到，风味描述先按照去年的照搬啦）；\n特征关键词：黄色红色柑橘+红色莓果核果+红茶感\n关于Uraga与Gogogu\nUraga地理位置位于Shakisso和Hambella之间，在我们国内的花魁的Hambella区域出现之前，Uraga和Shakisso就已经是除了耶加雪菲之外被消费者耳熟能详的名字了；\nUraga也是一个比较大的区域，下面有不同的村落和小农分布，就像之前我们用过的Uraga Tome与今年初售卖的\nDidahorab burka就分属于不同的小村落小农；\n图片来源：Ally Coffee\nhttps://www.allycoffee.com/coffees/guji-uraga-gogogu-washed-grade-1/\nGogogu位于Uraga区域下面的Wate Gogogu村落里，处理站是一个私有处理站，由\nNigusse Debela所拥有，\n于 2020 年建成于海拔 2100 米以上的地域，\n覆盖辖区内约 510 户咖啡种植农，辖区类咖啡的种植高度最高达到 2400 米，是整个古吉大产区最偏僻和\n海拔最高的区域之一。同时，Wate Village 也是 2025 年 TOH 非洲组水洗第一名的出产地；\n图片来源：Ally Coffee\nhttps://www.allycoffee.com/coffees/guji-uraga-gogogu-washed-grade-1/\n这个批次（去年的处理信息，今年估计也是类似的，暂且沿用哈）是采用传统的水洗处理法，挑选成熟度较高的鲜果，去除咖啡果肉后在发酵池中进行水洗发酵 60小时；\n发酵完成后放置在非洲晒床上晾晒，经过 17-20天的自然晾晒后入库储存，直到出口前进行脱壳筛选。\nUraga是我们从开始烘豆子就每年都连续采购和售卖的品相，今年的它有一如既往扎实的酸感，去年开始它就开始往清新的一挂走，今年依旧很细腻的酸甜感，比Beloya口感更醇厚，更偏柠檬和柚子类的柑橘调性，茶感可能因为它的触感很厚实圆润，给它的描述是类似红茶感～很棒！\n公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content autoTypeSetting24psection\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           基本信息\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<hr style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;border-right-width: 0px;border-style: solid;border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.098);border-bottom-width: 0px;border-left-width: 0px;transform: scale(1, 0.5);transform-origin: 0px 0px;\"/>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           国家：埃塞俄比亚 Ethiopia\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           产区：奥洛米亚洲-古吉-乌拉嘎 Oromia-Gu\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           ji-Uraga\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           村落：维特-果果谷\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-decoration: none;\">\n<span>\n            Wate Gogogu\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<span>\n           处理站：果果谷 Gogogu\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           负责人/拥有者：\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-decoration: none;\">\n<span>\n            Nigusse Debela（SNAP）\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           品种：原生种 Heirloom (Dega, Kurume)\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           海拔：2100 - 2300 米 masl\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           处理方式：水洗 Washed\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           采收处理： 2025.12 - 2026.1月\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           空运到港： 2026.4月\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           烘焙度：浅度 Light Roasted\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           风味：黄柠檬、葡萄柚、杏桃、红茶感\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color: black;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           Lemon, Grapefruit, Apricot, Black tea-like\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          今年的批次到库啦，和去年还是很一致的，依旧是扎实的酸感，柠檬红茶，还有一些杏桃和红心柚子的感受，饱满，风味辨识度非常高（据说还有花香，还还没有喝到，风味描述先按照去年的照搬啦）；\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 104, 39);font-weight: bold;\">\n           特征关键词：黄色红色柑橘+红色莓果核果+红茶感\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlajZ0qxia4sy1AmyTOCTwWo9icdSZb4AR6NO727rjxvdCVMQicHCBKdOONg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlaO8st3wWJAg8NrbKv0ymTtX1xo0yeJBml4nzPibBlPff0RqafqOu42FQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">\n<span>\n             关于Uraga与Gogogu\n            </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RtMS1bGFWf6PJhGpoLvJoE762R1hvZtMqQEG2GwicN4ehZ3EIsyI5ZcOiaKt0WHNGuN2ElbaekW2PQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           Uraga地理位置位于Shakisso和Hambella之间，在我们国内的花魁的Hambella区域出现之前，Uraga和Shakisso就已经是除了耶加雪菲之外被消费者耳熟能详的名字了；\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           Uraga也是一个比较大的区域，下面有不同的村落和小农分布，就像之前我们用过的Uraga Tome与今年初售卖的\n          </span>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<span>\n            Didahorab burka就分属于不同的小村落小农；\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RtMS1bGFWf6PJhGpoLvJoEJem1r3SjRLJAQUIsgDbZicCN5Eue8VstG1UqjbAwwhg5eSNRPkfWZbQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;font-size: 12px;\">\n<span>\n           图片来源：Ally Coffee\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-size: 12px;\">\n<span>\n<a class=\"normal_text_link\" data-linktype=\"2\" href=\"https://www.allycoffee.com/coffees/guji-uraga-gogogu-washed-grade-1/\" linktype=\"text\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0.034em;\" target=\"_blank\" textvalue=\"\">\n            https://www.allycoffee.com/coffees/guji-uraga-gogogu-washed-grade-1/\n           </a>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           Gogogu位于Uraga区域下面的Wate Gogogu村落里，处理站是一个私有处理站，由\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-decoration: none;\">\n<span>\n            Nigusse Debela所拥有，\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span>\n           于 2020 年建成于海拔 2100 米以上的地域，\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span>\n           覆盖辖区内约 510 户咖啡种植农，辖区类咖啡的种植高度最高达到 2400 米，是整个古吉大产区最偏僻和\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-decoration: none;\">\n<span>\n           海拔最高的区域之一。同时，Wate Village 也是 2025 年 TOH 非洲组水洗第一名的出产地；\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/Gr457cyFia7RtMS1bGFWf6PJhGpoLvJoECkyUs0rQa4kibbtfGUziaib4iaU9zmPqicpdric8mz1J0JpGBFgjxTnnoXlQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-align: center;font-size: 12px;\">\n<span>\n           图片来源：Ally Coffee\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"text-align: center;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-size: 12px;\">\n<span>\n<a class=\"normal_text_link\" data-linktype=\"2\" href=\"https://www.allycoffee.com/coffees/guji-uraga-gogogu-washed-grade-1/\" linktype=\"text\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0.034em;\" target=\"_blank\" textvalue=\"\">\n            https://www.allycoffee.com/coffees/guji-uraga-gogogu-washed-grade-1/\n           </a>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-decoration: none;\">\n<span>\n           这个批次（去年的处理信息，今年估计也是类似的，暂且沿用哈）是采用传统的水洗处理法，挑选成熟度较高的鲜果，去除咖啡果肉后在发酵池中进行水洗发酵 60小时；\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span>\n           发酵完成后放置在非洲晒床上晾晒，经过 17-20天的自然晾晒后入库储存，直到出口前进行脱壳筛选。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: left;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<span>\n           Uraga是我们从开始烘豆子就每年都连续采购和售卖的品相，今年的它有一如既往扎实的酸感，去年开始它就开始往清新的一挂走，今年依旧很细腻的酸甜感，比Beloya口感更醇厚，更偏柠檬和柚子类的柑橘调性，茶感可能因为它的触感很厚实圆润，给它的描述是类似红茶感～很棒！\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: left;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<span>\n           公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<span>\n           客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RicESSboT2yAGicv25eicYwA9eYTVnj6tnDXYWHJ5amUjBqzNK6pdB5dhozgCKLqOuf9IgicGe5pVLibQ/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1&amp;tp=webp\" style=\"outline: 0px;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
